/InvertedSimpleDot{dup mul exch dup mul add 1 sub}
/CosineDot{180 mul cos exch 180 mul cos add 2 div}
/Double{exch 2 div exch 2{360 mul sin 2 div exch}repeat add}
/InvertedDouble{
